<title>UK: Europe raw cotton demand slack, amid holidays.</title>
<headline>Europe raw cotton demand slack, amid holidays.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Competitive offers of Spanish, Greek and West African raw cotton occasionally found buyers on Thursday notably in Portugal, Italy and Germany but European demand generally remained weak during the holiday season.</p>
